{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In End of Blackjack, you will play humanity's last hands of the classic game in atmospheric first-person. Forgotten rules and strategies are now experienced only through these machines, replayed by copper and silicon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Blackjack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884650/extras/b71aebd4b572c3dca8f4f4fb8c5c7791.poster.avif?t=1774292880\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884650/extras/b71aebd4b572c3dca8f4f4fb8c5c7791.webm?t=1774292880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884650/extras/b71aebd4b572c3dca8f4f4fb8c5c7791.mp4?t=1774292880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit, stand, split, or vary your risk playing humanity\u2019s last hands of classic blackjack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear the clacking of your key strokes and the clinking of cards as the nights pass around you. The contraption feels engineered to withstand the acrid environment you find yourself in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your leisure, as this machine has no coin slots or expectations. Each hand dealt could be its last, but it is indifferent to its fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884650?t=1774292880","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884650/4551f67b9dd197e5a28ad2a921a2e538cb6ffa81/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774292880","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884650/7f2dec22974e36bc373fabbcde0717e8662d75c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774292880","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884650/7f2dec22974e36bc373fabbcde0717e8662d75c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774292880","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In End of Blackjack, you will play humanity's last hands of the classic game in atmospheric first-person. Forgotten rules and strategies are now experienced only through these machines, replayed by copper and silicon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Blackjack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884650/extras/b71aebd4b572c3dca8f4f4fb8c5c7791.poster.avif?t=1774292880\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884650/extras/b71aebd4b572c3dca8f4f4fb8c5c7791.webm?t=1774292880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884650/extras/b71aebd4b572c3dca8f4f4fb8c5c7791.mp4?t=1774292880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit, stand, split, or vary your risk playing humanity\u2019s last hands of classic blackjack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear the clacking of your key strokes and the clinking of cards as the nights pass around you. The contraption feels engineered to withstand the acrid environment you find yourself in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your leisure, as this machine has no coin slots or expectations. Each hand dealt could be its last, but it is indifferent to its fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["bluehexagons"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884650/33c4df22074221a6066fb3410b90ff692ef9aa34/header.jpg?t=1774292880","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright (c) 2019-2025 bluehexagons, llc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS or equivalent</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS or equivalent</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884650/678899505/25fc8fb091d28497fc010eb049b1c5e41d51b220/1760119259/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761247504","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884650/678899505/25fc8fb091d28497fc010eb049b1c5e41d51b220/1760119259/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761247504","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884650/678899505